  (descr "Kingbright APDA3020L 3.0x2.0mm low-current right-angle SMD LED family, AlGaInP red/yellow. Manufacturer recommended lands: two 2.0x1.0mm pads with 1.0mm gap (centers +/-1.5mm). Project pad numbering follows Salix LED_PORT semantics: pad 1 = anode, pad 2 = cathode. For AlGaInP red/yellow variants manufacturer terminal 1 is the anode-side physical land and terminal 2 the cathode-side land, so project pads 1/2 preserve the same physical order.")
